WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

02:04.560 --> 02:07.020
<i>Kanako-senpai is so wonderful!</i>

02:12.520 --> 02:14.110
Awesome!

02:14.110 --> 02:16.440
How pretty!

02:20.530 --> 02:24.910
Wow! So that's what the second best in the country is capable of!

02:26.540 --> 02:31.210
Kanako-senpai, you're sure to win first place in the next national championship!

02:31.210 --> 02:33.040
Unfortunately, that's not possible.

02:33.040 --> 02:35.050
She's going to get married soon.

02:35.050 --> 02:37.340
What?! Married?!

02:43.640 --> 02:45.220
Is it really true?

02:45.220 --> 02:48.310
That's right, to the boys' P.E. coach, Yamagiwa-senpai.

02:48.310 --> 02:51.810
To Yamagiwa-senpai?

02:53.440 --> 02:55.270
They're the perfect couple.

02:55.270 --> 03:00.110
You're so oblivious. You're the only one who didn't know.

03:00.110 --> 03:01.450
Am I?

03:01.450 --> 03:03.490
She said that her first love bloomed.

03:04.240 --> 03:07.330
I hope my first love will bloom, too.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.210
Miyako!

03:14.210 --> 03:17.210
I thought you were going to live your life as a detective?

03:21.590 --> 03:23.970
What's wrong? What's your response?

03:25.010 --> 03:26.510
Wait, Maron!

03:26.510 --> 03:28.810
- You're teasing me, aren't you?

03:27.810 --> 03:28.810
- Exactly!

03:28.810 --> 03:31.140
I won't forgive you for that!

03:31.480 --> 03:38.110
The Target is the Wedding Dress

03:44.240 --> 03:47.120
<i>Tonight will be a feast of green salad,</i>

03:47.120 --> 03:49.620
<i>pizza with lots of cheese,</i>

03:49.620 --> 03:52.120
<i>pasta with bacon and eggplant,</i>

03:52.120 --> 03:53.580
<i>and tiramisù for dessert!</i>

03:54.210 --> 03:56.540
Isn't that a calorie overload?

03:56.540 --> 03:57.710
Chiaki!

03:57.710 --> 03:59.920
I see you're having Italian tonight.

03:59.920 --> 04:02.550
How about inviting your neighbor over?

04:04.430 --> 04:08.140
Why would I want to invite you over for dinner?

04:08.140 --> 04:11.480
If we walk together like this, people will think of us as a couple.

04:11.480 --> 04:14.650
Nobody would think that!

04:14.650 --> 04:17.020
It looks more like "Beauty and the Beast."

04:17.020 --> 04:17.940
Beast?

04:17.940 --> 04:19.480
Kanako-senpai!

04:19.480 --> 04:22.530
Oh, Maron-chan! Shopping with your boyfriend?

04:22.530 --> 04:26.070
You're wrong! This guy isn't my boyfriend!

04:26.910 --> 04:29.040
It's just a coincidence that we're walking together.

04:30.410 --> 04:34.000
But if you walk together like that, you really will look like a couple.

04:34.000 --> 04:38.130
WHAT?! Anything but that!

04:38.130 --> 04:42.420
Kanako-senpai, where are you going with Yamagiwa-senpai?

04:42.420 --> 04:44.430
The marriage hotel.

04:44.430 --> 04:46.510
I'm going to try on my wedding dress.

04:46.510 --> 04:47.510
That's wonderful!

04:47.510 --> 04:48.640
See you later.

04:48.640 --> 04:49.430
Okay!

04:55.440 --> 04:59.020
Girls who act sweet towards guys are so pretty.

04:59.020 --> 05:00.480
Unlike you.

05:00.480 --> 05:04.450
It all depends on who the guy is.

05:04.450 --> 05:05.820
Damn uncute girl.

05:05.820 --> 05:07.450
"Uncute" is fine wth me!

05:22.920 --> 05:23.920
Chiaki!

05:26.130 --> 05:28.550
Chiaki, quit it okay?!

05:31.720 --> 05:36.520
<i>If you ever feel lonely, you can stop by my place anytime, baby.</i>

05:43.730 --> 05:46.110
What do you want?

05:46.110 --> 05:49.120
Stop putting weird letters in my box.

05:49.120 --> 05:51.830
You should forget about your parents.

05:54.040 --> 05:55.410
As a high school student...

05:55.410 --> 05:59.630
...you should be happier to receive a letter from a guy rather than your parents.

06:03.210 --> 06:05.260
Don't rely on your parents.

06:09.720 --> 06:14.020
People think their lives are the most important.

06:14.020 --> 06:19.770
You're wrong if you think that parents will take care of their children forever.

06:22.320 --> 06:24.440
What are you saying?!

06:24.440 --> 06:26.150
I don't understand any of it!

06:30.240 --> 06:32.240
<i>How does Chiaki know...</i>

06:33.330 --> 06:37.040
<i>...that I'm waiting for that letter? How...?</i>

06:42.840 --> 06:44.550
Coming!

06:44.550 --> 06:45.710
Who is it?

06:46.630 --> 06:49.130
Maraon, what are you doing?!

06:49.130 --> 06:51.760
You promised to do homework together!

06:53.430 --> 06:56.520
Geez, I've been waiting the whole time!

06:56.520 --> 06:57.770
Sorry!

07:06.150 --> 07:07.690
You look beautiful.

07:09.450 --> 07:13.990
Thank you. I hope your parents will be happy with this.

07:13.990 --> 07:15.830
Of course they will.

07:15.830 --> 07:18.620
But, is it really okay with you...

07:18.620 --> 07:21.250
...to wear my mother's dress?

07:21.250 --> 07:24.040
It's more than twenty years old.

07:24.960 --> 07:29.840
I'm so happy since the dress was given to me with so much love.

07:34.010 --> 07:36.350
This one is so pretty...

07:36.350 --> 07:39.520
Don't you think this dress would look great on Kanako-senpai?

07:39.520 --> 07:41.640
Hey Maron. We should study.

07:42.310 --> 07:45.020
This won't do. It has to be even more beautiful.

07:45.020 --> 07:46.440
You think so?

07:47.730 --> 07:48.940
Yes?

07:49.940 --> 07:50.610
Yo!

07:50.610 --> 07:53.070
You invited Chiaki, too?

07:53.070 --> 07:56.330
Yep, since Chiaki's so smart...

07:56.330 --> 07:59.580
...I thought he would be handy to have around if there's something we don't understand...

07:59.580 --> 08:01.120
...or something like that.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.040
Yeah, right...

08:02.040 --> 08:02.920
Did you say something?

08:02.920 --> 08:03.830
Not really.

08:03.830 --> 08:05.540
If I'm in the way, I'll go home.

08:05.540 --> 08:07.710
No, not at all!

08:07.710 --> 08:11.130
Hey, could you help me with Math, Japanese and English?

08:11.130 --> 08:13.510
I wish you wouldn't use me as bait!

08:13.510 --> 08:17.510
You're so beautiful. I wish I could show this to my mother.

08:20.430 --> 08:23.690
- I'm definitely going to wear a wedding dress!

08:23.690 --> 08:25.520
What do you think, Chiaki?

08:25.520 --> 08:27.230
I guess it's okay.

08:27.230 --> 08:31.240
You think so, too? Then that's how it'll be done!

08:31.240 --> 08:33.530
Whatever happened to studying Math?

08:34.110 --> 08:38.990
I knew it. A woman's happiness really comes from marrying a man she loves.

08:38.990 --> 08:42.000
Oh, so you don't want to become a detective anymore?

08:43.330 --> 08:44.620
That's not it!

08:44.620 --> 08:46.460
I'll have a peaceful life...

08:46.460 --> 08:49.550
...and still work as a detective!

08:50.710 --> 08:52.420
<i>Whatever...</i>

08:52.420 --> 08:55.340
- Something like a peaceful family life is a delusion.

08:54.550 --> 08:55.340
- Huh?

08:56.010 --> 08:57.510
It's only a fantasy.

09:02.520 --> 09:04.440
What's wrong?!

09:04.440 --> 09:05.640
Junji-san!

09:28.540 --> 09:30.540
- It's not a fantasy!

09:30.540 --> 09:34.130
Dad is working as a detective...

09:34.130 --> 09:37.220
...and also has a peaceful family life.

09:37.220 --> 09:40.220
I'm sure I can do it, too!

09:49.650 --> 09:50.650
What?!

09:50.650 --> 09:53.030
I can't believe that! This can't be true!

09:53.030 --> 09:56.320
But...he said he didn't want to marry me...

09:57.240 --> 09:58.160
No way!

09:58.740 --> 10:03.910
He started acting weirdly when I was trying on my wedding dress.

10:03.910 --> 10:05.620
He changed suddenly...

10:07.750 --> 10:10.130
<i>The wedding is off!</i>

10:13.340 --> 10:15.340
<i>There's no such thing as love!</i>

10:16.050 --> 10:18.930
Tomorrow is our wedding...

10:20.640 --> 10:24.270
I don't even know where he is now...

10:25.140 --> 10:26.640
I'm such an idiot!

10:28.310 --> 10:30.520
There must be a reason for this...

10:30.520 --> 10:32.730
We should believe in him.

10:32.730 --> 10:34.820
Let's believe and wait for him.

10:38.610 --> 10:41.030
I thought love was supposed to be strong.

10:41.030 --> 10:47.540
I can't believe that a couple so deeply in love could break up.

10:51.130 --> 10:52.250
Break up...

10:53.630 --> 10:55.210
Maron...

10:55.210 --> 11:00.550
<i>Mama and Papa might have to get a divorce. </i>

11:00.930 --> 11:02.970
Maron, what are you doing?

11:08.230 --> 11:10.310
The Petit Claire is reacting to a Demon...

11:10.310 --> 11:11.440
Why?

11:16.230 --> 11:17.230
It can't be!

11:27.240 --> 11:30.000
Notice

11:27.240 --> 11:30.000
Don't go away!

11:27.240 --> 11:30.000
I'll return right after these messages!

11:27.240 --> 11:30.000
Kaitou Jeanne

11:30.920 --> 11:33.500
Notice

11:30.920 --> 11:33.500
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:30.920 --> 11:33.500
Kaitou Jeanne

11:45.890 --> 11:47.930
Fin, please come back.

11:56.900 --> 11:58.480
Big trouble! We're in big trouble!

11:59.610 --> 12:02.990
I found a Demon! It's in the marriage hotel!

12:02.990 --> 12:04.490
The marriage hotel?

12:04.490 --> 12:08.700
Yep! I saw Access near that place!

12:09.290 --> 12:11.710
I followed him...

12:13.710 --> 12:16.880
<i>Access! What are you doing here?!</i>

12:16.880 --> 12:18.800
<i>Crap!</i>

12:18.800 --> 12:22.340
<i>Stop right there! Are you planning something bad again?</i>

12:22.340 --> 12:26.930
<i>I know you're the Devil's servant, so don't tell me you've had a change of heart!</i>

12:26.930 --> 12:29.430
<i>That's not it!</i>

12:29.430 --> 12:32.310
<i>No! I'll make you stop!</i>

12:32.310 --> 12:34.270
<i>I can't tell you anything right now!</i>

12:34.270 --> 12:37.610
<i>Who is Sinbad? Where is he?</i>

12:37.610 --> 12:38.860
<i>Just tell me!</i>

12:39.780 --> 12:44.030
<i>I can't tell you, but I still like you! I'm not joking! I really do!</i>

12:45.200 --> 12:49.530
I'm not so dumb as to be fooled by something like that!

12:50.080 --> 12:57.580
So I checked around the place and found a Demon in the wedding dress at the marriage hotel.

13:02.590 --> 13:06.300
<i>A Demon inside Kanako-senpai's wedding dress?</i>

13:06.300 --> 13:10.260
<i>If I seal the Demon, the dress would disappear as well.</i>

13:10.260 --> 13:12.390
<i>I can't let that happen!</i>

13:12.390 --> 13:14.810
<i>I'm going to try on my wedding dress!</i>

13:17.230 --> 13:22.690
Damn that Access! He keeps meddling in my business!

13:23.780 --> 13:24.860
What's wrong?

13:26.490 --> 13:28.200
Maron?!

13:28.200 --> 13:30.700
What are you thinking about?

13:30.700 --> 13:34.790
If we don't hurry, Sinbad and Access are going to finish the job before us!

13:34.790 --> 13:36.290
I know!

13:37.080 --> 13:39.580
I'll definitely protect the wedding dress!

13:41.590 --> 13:49.390
<i>Notice: To the owner of the marriage hotel: I will take the beauty of the wedding dress. - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

14:01.900 --> 14:04.110
All right. The guards are prepared.

14:09.070 --> 14:12.950
What's wrong, Miyako? You seem to be more serious than usual.

14:12.950 --> 14:17.120
Dad, I'll still be a detective even if I get married.

14:17.120 --> 14:20.080
Geh! What brought this on so suddenly?

14:20.080 --> 14:22.790
I'm a family detective that lives on love!

14:22.790 --> 14:26.010
I'll work even if I have to carry a child with me!

14:26.010 --> 14:27.380
Family detective?!

14:27.380 --> 14:28.970
<i>Wait!</i>

14:31.800 --> 14:33.220
<i>There seem to be no problems here!</i>

14:33.970 --> 14:37.980
Stop talking into the transceiver while looking at the security camera!

14:37.980 --> 14:39.980
Fuyuta-san, what's the situation down there?

14:40.400 --> 14:42.270
Nothing is wrong in the restaurant.

14:42.270 --> 14:46.400
Miyako-san, what kind of trap did you set up this time?

14:46.400 --> 14:51.570
It's a secret. In order to fool the enemy, the guards must be fooled as well.

14:51.570 --> 14:53.910
Two hours until the wedding.

14:55.290 --> 14:57.000
<i>We should believe in him.</i>

14:57.870 --> 15:00.370
<i>There must be a reason for this.</i>

15:00.370 --> 15:02.830
<i>Let's believe and wait for him.</i>

15:03.210 --> 15:04.880
<i>Junji-san...</i>

15:04.880 --> 15:07.590
<i>I must have faith that he will come back for the wedding.</i>

15:14.600 --> 15:16.970
There are many guards. Be careful!

15:16.970 --> 15:17.890
I will!

15:18.810 --> 15:22.690
I wonder how Sinbad and Access are going to sneak in?

15:22.690 --> 15:25.480
I'll finish the job before them.

15:29.190 --> 15:30.900
Pervert!!!

15:32.070 --> 15:33.700
This man's a pervert!!

15:37.290 --> 15:39.700
Check on the people in the lobby.

15:39.700 --> 15:41.000
Haruta, roger!

15:41.290 --> 15:42.370
Natsuda, roger!

15:42.960 --> 15:43.710
Akita, roger!

15:45.880 --> 15:47.300
Fuyuta, roger!

15:50.170 --> 15:51.010
Damn!

15:51.010 --> 15:51.970
Is that Sinbad?!

15:57.600 --> 16:01.060
Damn, calling me a pervert...

16:05.270 --> 16:06.770
A job well done.

16:14.070 --> 16:16.620
Akita-san, check that lady over there!

16:17.490 --> 16:18.910
Excuse me, Miss.

16:20.290 --> 16:23.210
Could you come to the security room with me?

16:23.210 --> 16:24.670
I have someth--

16:25.380 --> 16:26.670
St-Stop!

16:36.180 --> 16:38.010
OUCH!!!

16:43.100 --> 16:44.480
Maron!

16:44.480 --> 16:46.980
I can't forgive a Demon who obstructs love.

16:46.980 --> 16:48.190
Here we go!

16:54.200 --> 16:56.490
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

17:06.880 --> 17:08.880
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

17:08.880 --> 17:10.710
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

17:10.710 --> 17:12.460
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

17:18.390 --> 17:20.180
In the name of God...

17:20.180 --> 17:21.680
You, a Demon bo--

17:21.680 --> 17:24.810
Huh?! The Petit Claire isn't reacting to the dress!

17:24.810 --> 17:26.140
Is it a decoy?

17:26.600 --> 17:30.110
<i>- Kaitou Jeanne, I can see everything you do!</i>

17:30.480 --> 17:31.400
<i>Miyako!</i>

17:32.190 --> 17:35.400
The only way out is the entrance covered by the guards.

17:35.400 --> 17:37.660
You're nothing more than a rat in a trap!

17:40.410 --> 17:41.990
<i>That's the tenth floor.</i>

17:41.990 --> 17:43.790
<i>Are you planning to fly like a bird?</i>

17:45.000 --> 17:47.040
Sounds good. I'll try that!

17:51.800 --> 17:52.750
Fire!

18:10.480 --> 18:12.400
She escaped to a lower floor! Chase her!

18:12.400 --> 18:14.190
You're good, Jeanne!

18:14.190 --> 18:16.400
Miyako! You should stay here!

18:17.400 --> 18:20.200
Damn that girl... What makes her act this way?

18:32.880 --> 18:35.630
<i>Miyako, what did you set up this time?</i>

18:45.890 --> 18:46.930
<i>Yamagiwa-senpai?</i>

19:04.280 --> 19:07.200
Stop! There's someone waiting for you!

19:09.000 --> 19:10.120
You can't hear me, huh?

19:28.890 --> 19:30.190
Kaitou Jeanne.

19:30.190 --> 19:34.770
How do you like this Miyako Special, the "Blinding Smoke Launcher?"

19:38.280 --> 19:40.700
Well then... Stand up, Jeanne!

19:41.070 --> 19:41.910
<i>Now!</i>

19:57.500 --> 20:00.470
<i>Demon, are you going to stay inside that dress?</i>

20:06.100 --> 20:07.810
In the name of God...

20:10.810 --> 20:13.100
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:14.400 --> 20:16.310
I seal you here!

20:16.690 --> 20:19.320
<i>Damn you, Jeanne!</i>

20:19.980 --> 20:21.780
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:29.910 --> 20:32.080
My plan was successful.

20:32.080 --> 20:33.790
The dress is okay.

20:34.500 --> 20:35.580
Jeanne!

20:40.300 --> 20:43.590
You were pretty tough, Miss Detective.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.590
Adieu.

20:45.590 --> 20:48.600
Stop, Jeanne! I'll shoot...!

20:53.480 --> 20:55.980
We'll call it a draw this time.

21:00.980 --> 21:03.950
What...was I doing?

21:03.950 --> 21:05.900
Junji-san!

21:07.700 --> 21:09.080
Kanako-san!

21:25.180 --> 21:28.180
- Miyako, you did well...

21:28.180 --> 21:32.020
- But I couldn't arrest Jeanne or Sinbad.

21:32.020 --> 21:36.310
- There will be more chances to catch them...

21:36.310 --> 21:40.400
- But the most important thing is that the wedding dress was saved.

21:40.400 --> 21:41.610
-That's right...

21:41.610 --> 21:48.110
Everyone, please welcome the newlywed couple with a big round of applause!

21:56.500 --> 21:59.040
- Congratulations, Kanako-senpai!

22:00.710 --> 22:02.550
Live happily ever after!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:33.140 --> 23:36.010
<i>I see... you're scared of darkness.</i>

23:36.010 --> 23:36.890
Who is it?!

23:36.890 --> 23:40.230
<i>Jeanne, whatever you do is futile.</i>

23:40.230 --> 23:42.400
What I'm doing is futile...?

23:42.400 --> 23:46.110
<i>No one needs you for what you are doing!</i>

23:46.110 --> 23:48.860
I'm all alone...

23:48.860 --> 23:52.660
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Forceful Confession at the Amusement Park!

23:53.410 --> 23:57.790
The one to decide whether my actions are futile or not...isn't you...

23:57.790 --> 23:59.330
It's me!
